lines+=['','For required form/control boundaries, propose dark #89919d or light #767676 and verify >=3:1 against both adjacent surfaces. For hierarchy-only surfaces, retain the approved true-black base and use a thin boundary before adding another material. Identical nested backgrounds are often intentional and should not all be changed.','', '## All axe violations (deduplicated nodes)','', '| Theme | Rule | Impact | Selector | Evidence |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
